a succubus at first.  She replied "

Fine goods for sale:

a lamp, 6 zorkmids
a lamp, 6 zorkmids
a lamp, 6 zorkmids
a lamp, 8 zorkmids
a lamp, 8 zorkmids
a lamp, 6 zorkmids
