"
I don't know how much a regular oil lamp is supposed to cost, but I
know a magic one would cost a whole lot more than these do.  I picked
one of the lamps...

c - a lamp (unpaid, 6 zorkmids).

and Nnc-ed it "NORML" (sic).  These cheap imitations won't fool me
again!

...Unless there happens to be a hostile mind-flayer hiding in the
